"interrompue. Appel : {info}"

#: hetu/endpoint/connection.py:330
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"⚠️ [📞Endpoint] [非法操作] 收到消息数过多({received_msgs} in "
"{received_elapsed}s)，可能是flood攻击，将断开连接。调用：{info}"
msgstr ""
"⚠️ [📞Endpoint] [Opération illégale] Trop de messages reçus ({received_msgs} "
"en {received_elapsed}s), possible attaque par inondation, la connexion sera "
"interrompue. Appel : {info}"

